01:30.660 --> 01:33.860
Brancos Stadium - Brazil

01:36.230 --> 02:38.540
Tsubasa! Tsubasa! Tsubasa!

01:43.680 --> 01:44.540
Pepe!

01:50.140 --> 01:51.860
That was a great chance...

01:55.330 --> 01:57.460
Keep this up in the second half!

01:58.510 --> 02:02.500
They have all come to cheer you on for your last game here.

02:06.500 --> 02:12.140
It makes me really happy that Brazilians cheer this much for a Japanese guy.

02:12.140 --> 02:15.970
It doesn't matter whether you are Brazilian or Japanese.

02:15.970 --> 02:20.500
On this pitch, we are all equal when under the rules of soccer.

02:20.500 --> 02:24.380
You were the one who taught me that, Tsubasa.

02:24.380 --> 02:25.900
I did?

02:25.900 --> 02:31.510
Yeah, when we met during the tryouts for the Brancos.

02:31.510 --> 02:33.240
The tryouts, eh?

02:33.240 --> 02:35.290
Those sure bring back memories.

02:40.460 --> 02:45.580
<b>To a New Field</b>

02:40.460 --> 02:45.580
<b>To a New Field</b>

02:48.280 --> 02:51.740
Is that everything you're taking with you, Tsubasa?

02:52.430 --> 02:55.980
I'll just buy what I need when I get there.

02:55.980 --> 02:59.330
That is true. You're not merely visiting.

02:59.330 --> 03:02.510
Give my regards to Roberto when you get to Brazil.

03:02.510 --> 03:03.470
Sure!

03:04.980 --> 03:06.220
Well then,

03:06.680 --> 03:07.660
Papa,

03:09.110 --> 03:10.170
Mama,

03:11.510 --> 03:12.980
I'm off!

03:12.980 --> 03:15.770
Write to us every once in a while.

03:15.770 --> 03:16.820
Sure!

03:18.240 --> 03:20.340
He's really gone.

03:20.340 --> 03:26.110
It's always been Tsubasa's dream to be a soccer player in Brazil.

03:27.540 --> 03:32.450
I will miss him, but we have to let him chase his dream.

03:32.450 --> 03:34.110
He can't be stopped.

03:34.110 --> 03:35.180
That is true.

03:38.760 --> 03:39.710
He's here!

03:41.060 --> 03:43.300
Hey, Tsubasa!

03:43.530 --> 03:45.020
Guys!

03:48.250 --> 03:52.260
So you really are going, Tsubasa?

03:52.260 --> 03:53.500
Yeah.

03:53.500 --> 03:55.020
Work hard.

03:55.020 --> 03:58.500
Please send us pictures of Brazilian players!

03:59.310 --> 04:02.500
We'll be cheering for you here!

04:02.500 --> 04:06.500
Come on now, Tsubasa-kun is going to make his dream come true.

04:06.960 --> 04:10.550
You are ruining everything by crying like that!

04:11.730 --> 04:15.860
Tsubasa-kun, take this to eat on the airplane.

04:15.860 --> 04:17.780
Take care!

04:17.780 --> 04:20.300
Thank you very much!

04:25.780 --> 04:27.300
Ah, that's right.

04:27.300 --> 04:31.500
Manager, didn't you have something to give him?

04:32.360 --> 04:33.610
Y-Yes.

04:43.330 --> 04:46.430
Here, Tsubasa-kun.

04:50.380 --> 04:52.140
Is it okay if I open it?

05:00.100 --> 05:03.540
Wow! New cleats!

05:03.540 --> 05:07.420
I thought this was the perfect gift for you.

05:07.870 --> 05:11.020
Thank you! I will use them!

05:16.980 --> 05:18.260
Well then,

05:20.070 --> 05:23.580
I'm giving this to you, Sanae-chan.

05:27.580 --> 05:29.570
I'm off.

05:30.150 --> 05:31.380
Take care.

05:34.050 --> 05:34.890
I will.

05:39.620 --> 05:41.060
Good luck!

05:41.060 --> 05:43.900
Don't lose to the Brazilians!

05:43.900 --> 05:45.060
Hang in there!

05:45.060 --> 05:48.820
Become the world's best soccer player!

05:48.820 --> 05:50.340
Be careful!

05:50.340 --> 05:52.120
Do your best!

05:52.120 --> 05:54.800
See you, Tsubasa!

05:54.800 --> 05:56.690
See you soon!

05:56.690 --> 05:57.980
Tsubasa-kun.

05:57.170 --> 05:59.310
Have a nice trip.

06:01.180 --> 06:02.100
Your dream...

06:03.090 --> 06:04.830
make your dreams come true!

06:15.140 --> 06:16.300
Nice, Wakashimazu!

06:19.140 --> 06:20.780
Over here, Sorimachi!

06:21.620 --> 06:22.580
All right!

06:25.100 --> 06:29.100
Tsubasa, you beat me to it once again.

06:29.100 --> 06:33.090
I will make sure to become a pro one day, and then I will catch up to you!

06:33.090 --> 06:34.880
Until then, wait for me!

06:42.040 --> 06:45.530
I just transferred here. My name is Misaki Taro.

06:45.530 --> 06:46.540
Mi—

06:46.540 --> 06:48.540
Misaki!

06:48.540 --> 06:55.540
Nankatsu High School

06:49.030 --> 06:50.950
I'm surprised you're back!

06:50.950 --> 06:55.540
The art gallery at Nankatsu gave my father a new project.

06:55.540 --> 07:04.620
All right! Now Nankatsu High won't lose against the Toho Academy, even without Tsubasa!

07:05.930 --> 07:07.180
That's right.

07:08.090 --> 07:12.960
Tsubasa-kun has finally taken his first step to become a professional.

07:15.570 --> 07:17.920
Tsubasa-kun, how are you?

07:17.920 --> 07:23.100
Going to Brazil right after junior high school to train as a pro

07:23.100 --> 07:25.770
sure sounds like something you would do.

07:25.770 --> 07:31.900
I am currently studying hard in a pre-med high school.

07:32.270 --> 07:35.970
But I haven't given up on soccer, of course.

07:35.970 --> 07:39.980
I am planning to succeed in both!

07:40.900 --> 07:47.780
One day, wherever it will be in this world, I look forward to being on the same pitch as you.

07:51.630 --> 07:54.620
Everybody is walking towards their dreams.

07:56.540 --> 07:58.520
I can't lose to them!

08:14.740 --> 08:17.380
Brazil - Sao Paulo {Note:  I don't know how to get the "squiggly line" that belongs above the "a" in "Sao", so I'd appreciate it if someone could put that in for me.}

08:31.920 --> 08:33.220
Roberto!

08:33.690 --> 08:35.640
There you are, Tsubasa!

08:37.840 --> 08:38.940
I was waiting for you!

08:40.380 --> 08:42.620
Roberto!

08:42.620 --> 08:43.870
Tsubasa!

08:48.760 --> 08:52.180
You must be tired after traveling halfway around the world.

08:52.180 --> 08:57.700
Not at all! I'm excited to be in Brazil, the land of soccer.

08:58.470 --> 08:59.420
I see.

09:06.700 --> 09:08.270
The stadium!

09:08.270 --> 09:09.750
Stop here, Roberto!

09:26.190 --> 09:27.970
It's huge!

09:27.980 --> 09:30.780
This will soon become your stage.

09:31.400 --> 09:32.260
Yeah!

09:42.860 --> 09:44.850
This is the dormitory of the Brancos.

09:44.850 --> 09:46.500
There are so many people here!

09:46.500 --> 09:51.980
The tryouts for youth, ages 16-17, will be held tomorrow.

09:51.980 --> 09:57.980
For a reputable club like the Brancos, the candidates come from all over Brazil.

09:58.420 --> 10:03.020
They are all dreaming about becoming professional players, too.

10:03.020 --> 10:06.040
Hey, look! It's Roberto Hongo.

10:06.040 --> 10:06.660
You're right!

10:09.000 --> 10:12.950
Roberto, I did not come here for nothing.

10:12.950 --> 10:13.950
I'll go for it!

10:13.950 --> 10:15.420
Go for it!

10:16.050 --> 10:18.420
Tsubasa, let me give you a bit of advice:

10:19.660 --> 10:25.740
The soccer played here in Brazil is a lot tougher than the soccer played in Japan.

10:25.740 --> 10:28.500
It's not all about ideals like dreams and hopes.

10:29.220 --> 10:31.740
In this country, soccer is everything.

10:31.740 --> 10:38.220
These guys have come here, putting everything on the line, for their families and for their future.

10:39.510 --> 10:44.460
The pros put their life on the line. Be sure to remember these words.

10:45.030 --> 10:45.850
Yes!

10:49.500 --> 10:52.410
I have made special arrangements for you to sleep here tonight.

10:52.410 --> 10:56.740
It is a special dorm for candidates who have traveled far.

10:57.390 --> 10:59.740
This is all I can do for you.

11:00.180 --> 11:04.220
Tsubasa, do your best during tomorrow's tryouts.

11:04.220 --> 11:05.390
I will!

11:15.860 --> 11:18.340
U-Um...

11:19.310 --> 11:20.580
Those cleats...

11:22.320 --> 11:25.150
He must've practiced until they were worn out like that.

11:26.220 --> 11:29.340
I came from Japan for the tryouts.

11:29.340 --> 11:31.220
Nice to meet you. I am Ohzora...

11:34.690 --> 11:37.440
Is it all right if I use that bed?

11:54.840 --> 11:56.750
New cleats, eh?

11:56.750 --> 11:59.420
Damn rich Japanese kid!

12:00.760 --> 12:06.740
Sanae-chan, I will definitely pass tomorrow's tryouts with these cleats!

12:10.070 --> 12:13.980
I need to pass tomorrow's tryouts!

12:18.410 --> 12:21.980
We can only afford a one-way ticket, but...

12:21.980 --> 12:24.280
Are you sure you'll be fine?

12:24.280 --> 12:25.890
Of course, I'll be fine!

12:25.890 --> 12:29.620
I'll pass for sure, so I won't need a return ticket.

12:30.090 --> 12:32.940
Hang in there, big bro!

12:32.940 --> 12:37.540
Listen up, be sure to properly help Mom, okay?

12:42.940 --> 12:44.210
See ya!

12:49.820 --> 12:53.300
I don't have any place to return to anymore.

12:53.300 --> 12:57.940
That is why I have to pass the tryouts at all costs and become a pro.

12:58.650 --> 13:00.460
There's no other path I can take!

13:06.040 --> 13:12.900
I need to become a professional player, 
so I can support my mother and siblings.

13:27.340 --> 13:31.060
Is he the Japanese guy Roberto Hongo brought yesterday?

13:36.260 --> 13:37.500
Yeah.

13:41.480 --> 13:44.100
Do the Japanese even know how to play soccer?

13:58.010 --> 13:59.910
I can't be losing to him!

14:02.990 --> 14:04.260
Yo.

14:04.260 --> 14:05.790
Yo, what's going on?

14:05.790 --> 14:11.340
There is no game today. Why is a sports journalist hanging around here?

14:11.340 --> 14:17.860
Roberto, I was told you brought over the soccer prodigy, Tsubasa Ohzora, from Japan.

14:18.310 --> 14:19.780
I'm here to cover him.

14:19.780 --> 14:25.380
Tsubasa led the Japanese Junior Youth team to the world title, after all.

14:25.380 --> 14:31.930
Part of my job as a journalist is to cover a future world superstar.

14:33.070 --> 14:34.180
I see.

14:36.130 --> 14:38.500
It's finally time!

14:38.500 --> 14:42.300
Hey, there are two kids mixed in with us.

14:43.420 --> 14:46.340
Why don't you hurry up and go back to your mamas,

14:46.340 --> 14:49.660
instead of failing the tryouts and breaking into tears?

14:49.660 --> 14:51.400
Don't mess with me.

14:51.400 --> 14:53.140
You just watch me pass!

14:54.860 --> 15:01.460
I can't imagine how you can play decent soccer with those trashy cleats.

15:01.460 --> 15:02.880
What?!

15:02.880 --> 15:04.220
Who cares?

15:04.220 --> 15:07.890
Just show them you're better at soccer than they are.

15:07.890 --> 15:09.860
I know. You don't have to tell me.

15:10.400 --> 15:13.140
I have to pass at all costs.

15:13.140 --> 15:15.860
Line up over here, candidates.

15:17.650 --> 15:20.760
The tryouts will be a game.

15:20.760 --> 15:23.800
Stay if we call your name after the game.

15:23.800 --> 15:25.420
The others are free to go home.

15:25.700 --> 15:28.140
First off, the candidates for the forward position.

15:28.140 --> 15:30.010
Here, here, here!

15:30.010 --> 15:33.900
I'm Pepe from Campo Grande. Please let me be a forward!

15:35.030 --> 15:37.180
His name is Pepe?

15:37.180 --> 15:39.620
All right, forwards, come over here.

15:43.900 --> 15:47.460
I will pass! No matter what!

15:47.890 --> 15:49.700
Next up, the midfielders.

15:49.940 --> 15:50.460
Here!

15:52.370 --> 15:56.940
We won't go easy on you just because Roberto brought you here.

15:57.260 --> 15:58.180
All right.

15:59.190 --> 16:01.780
I'm on the same team as him?

16:02.870 --> 16:09.230
He wears brand-new cleats like a true athlete, but the Japanese suck at soccer!

16:09.230 --> 16:11.620
He's just trying to look cool!

16:11.620 --> 16:14.620
We will begin the tryouts for the Brancos.

16:14.620 --> 16:18.860
Show all of your techniques and skills during this game.

16:19.370 --> 16:24.830
We will decide who to pass after fairly evaluating each of you.

16:26.570 --> 16:30.420
Tsubasa, show them what your soccer is all about.

16:31.260 --> 16:34.660
That number 18 is the kid you vouched for?

16:35.100 --> 16:35.930
Yes.

16:36.460 --> 16:38.380
Let's see what he's got.

16:40.140 --> 16:42.020
All right! Here I go!

16:42.020 --> 16:46.620
This is the moment when I take my first step in Brazilian soccer!

16:51.870 --> 16:52.580
There!

16:55.180 --> 16:57.140
Thanks, kid.

16:57.820 --> 17:04.220
Hey brats, kids should just sit there and watch my display!

17:06.260 --> 17:09.060
Hey, pass! Your marker is following you!

17:09.520 --> 17:12.460
You just need to keep quiet and watch, Japanese boy!

17:14.780 --> 17:18.700
It seems Tsubasa still doesn't know how the Brazilian selection process works.

17:19.580 --> 17:22.020
I won't let you have the ball!

17:22.020 --> 17:26.880
Number 18, you won't survive the tryouts unless you show what you've got!

17:27.930 --> 17:31.460
This is not good. I have to get the ball somehow.

17:37.740 --> 17:41.170
Damn, I haven't been able to get the ball at all since the game started.

17:41.170 --> 17:44.380
At this rate, the tryouts will be over before I can even do anything!

17:48.180 --> 17:49.520
All right!

17:49.520 --> 17:51.420
I'm taking it!

17:52.290 --> 17:57.660
In order to survive the tryouts, I have to show myself to the judges.

17:57.660 --> 18:02.660
Make sure you watch my play! I'm dribbling through!

18:07.340 --> 18:09.860
He's good, just like I thought.

18:10.850 --> 18:13.940
It's a smooth dribble, using the sides of his feet.

18:13.940 --> 18:15.940
Kid, I'm stopping you!

18:16.480 --> 18:19.460
Pepe, you're keeping the ball for too long. It'll get stolen from you!

18:22.940 --> 18:24.860
Damn, I lost it!

18:26.420 --> 18:27.420
What?

18:29.400 --> 18:31.420
Nice! Well played, Tsubasa!

18:32.980 --> 18:34.660
All right, let's do this, Pepe!

18:34.660 --> 18:39.660
What? Why is he calling me by my name? Damn you, Japanese kid!

18:41.060 --> 18:44.730
Damn it! I don't care if you're on my team or not.

18:44.730 --> 18:47.540
I will take the ball from you and create a chance to show myself!

18:51.130 --> 18:56.660
I'm running at full speed, but I still can't catch up to him!

18:56.660 --> 19:00.420
What quick and precise dribbling!

19:00.420 --> 19:02.700
Is he really Japanese?

19:03.740 --> 19:07.940
All right, we are in the attacking third.
Run towards the goal, Pepe!

19:07.940 --> 19:10.820
I know. You don't have to tell me!

19:11.660 --> 19:13.300
You're preparing to attack, Tsubasa?

19:14.220 --> 19:16.790
You'll fake going through the middle, and...

19:17.600 --> 19:18.540
Pepe!

19:20.820 --> 19:21.940
A through pass!

19:22.420 --> 19:27.100
He lured the defensive line and passed the ball, barely avoiding an offside call!

19:28.170 --> 19:33.360
This pass came through on the ideal path for me to shoot.

19:34.900 --> 19:35.420
Take this!

19:39.070 --> 19:40.570
I scored!

19:40.570 --> 19:42.700
Nice shot, Pepe!

19:42.700 --> 19:44.570
You did it! We scored the first goal!

19:44.570 --> 19:47.220
Nice shot and goal, Pepe!

19:47.220 --> 19:50.770
That was a great pass, even if it was a fluke.

19:50.770 --> 19:53.940
Since I'm left-footed, it was perfect for me.

19:53.940 --> 19:56.180
Yeah, I noticed your cleats!

19:56.660 --> 19:58.290
My cleats?

19:59.180 --> 20:04.210
Yeah. Since the side of your left shoe is worn out,

20:04.210 --> 20:07.660
I thought you were left-footed and passed.

20:08.440 --> 20:13.590
H-He paid that much attention and made that pass?

20:15.330 --> 20:16.860
Y-You...

20:19.100 --> 20:22.900
Your name... I didn't hear your full name yet.

20:23.350 --> 20:25.250
My name is Tsubasa.

20:25.250 --> 20:30.280
I came here from Japan, to become the world's number one soccer player.

20:30.280 --> 20:31.380
World's number one?

20:31.820 --> 20:32.750
Yes!

20:34.800 --> 20:36.460
I am Ohzora Tsubasa!

20:38.420 --> 20:41.340
I-Incredible! That was a drive shot!

20:43.250 --> 20:44.580
Roberto?

20:45.650 --> 20:49.600
It seems like I worried for nothing, Tsubasa.

20:49.600 --> 20:54.040
I will take my time to train you from now on.

20:57.960 --> 21:00.610
And now I will announce those who passed.

21:00.610 --> 21:05.060
Number 7, 18, and 50. That is it.

21:06.150 --> 21:08.080
I did it, Roberto!

21:08.080 --> 21:12.060
Hey, he did say number 7, right?

21:13.280 --> 21:15.060
Number 7?

21:15.060 --> 21:17.310
Yeah, that's what he said.

21:17.310 --> 21:18.780
He did, didn't he?

21:20.780 --> 21:23.780
YES! I passed!

21:23.780 --> 21:26.980
I passed!

21:28.780 --> 21:31.140
You are incredible!

21:31.920 --> 21:34.180
I did not say "nice to meet you" yet, did I?

21:36.620 --> 21:39.140
Likewise, nice to meet you!

21:41.480 --> 21:46.920
Tsubasa, train yourself hard here in Brazil and become the world's number one soccer player!

21:46.920 --> 21:50.540
Your battle has just begun, Tsubasa.

21:52.490 --> 22:02.540
Tsubasa! Tsubasa! Tsubasa!

